  - no model links / `{{campaign_url}}`;
  - retry classes;
  - auth;
  - message states;
  - receipts not done;
  - burst;
  - compose test DB with per-package template clones (rejected `-p 1` as slower and still order-dependent);
  - ASCII city slugs (Turkish İ/i casing);
  - compiler takes `asOf`;
  - seed anchored at load time;
